@startuml

!include docs/uml/theme.puml

actor User
participant "ShadeNav UI" as UI
participant "Trip Manager" as TripMgr

== Start trip definition ==

User -> UI : Open ShadeNav
User -> UI : Select “Plan Route”

alt Single destination (A→B)
    User -> UI : Enter origin and destination
else Multi-stop
    User -> UI : Enter list of stops
end

User -> UI : Confirm trip

== Process trip internally ==

UI -> TripMgr : Validate trip data
TripMgr -> TripMgr : Create trip object (to M2)

@enduml
